{"c":{"257562":["Hitori Gotou","Female","b257562-Ru35NYPfsqhY.png","Gotou Hitori is a shy, gloomy high-schooler who started learning guitar after seeing rock bands on TV, in the hope that she too could become as popular as them. However, after 2 years she has yet to make a single friend or join a band.",12448],"261674":["Nijika Ijichi","Female","b261674-a8tJYvtzqWgC.png","An energetic and cheerful second-year high school student. She is the drummer of Kessoku Band and the organizer who takes care of Hitori. She has an older sister, Seika, who is the manager of the live house \"STARRY\" and has a special feeling for the live house.",6808],"264529":["Ryou Yamada","Female","b264529-BvEusZnJLD2Y.png","A cool and solitary second year of high school. She is in charge of the bass of Kessoku Band. She's the best friend of Nijika. Her hobbies are out of the ordinary, and she rejoices when called a weirdo.",6395],"266041":["Ikuyo Kita","Female","b266041-1HKgjJGP2MmM.png","A bright and popular first year of high school. She is in charge of the guitar and vocals of Kessoku Band. She is a cheerful character who likes to interact with people and can talk to her with a smile without hesitation, even when she meets her for the first time.",4073],"289054":["Seika Ijichi","Female","b289054-UnScwd5RkqBk.png","Nijika's older sister and manager of the live house \"STARRY\".",1176],"289055":["PA-san","Female","b289055-khOP70WdXl2V.jpg","Mysterious looking female PA engineer with a mouth piercing. In her private life, she is active as a virtual Youtuber under the name \"Otogi Alto\" producing gameplay videos.",1097],"289056":["Jimihen",null,"b289056-Eob1bSBYL1ry.png","The Gotou family dog.",162],"289057":["Naoki Gotou","Male","b289057-kxpKjfUu0KDi.png","Hitori and Futari's father.",53],"289058":["Michiyo Gotou","Female","b289058-5RE0lhteKG3P.png","Hitori and Futari's mother.",60],"289059":["Futari Gotou","Female","b289059-AbMjfO2YoThz.png","Hitori's younger sister.",141],"289545":["Kita's